---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getPageSeo } from '../lib/pageSeo';

const { title, description, ogTitle, ogDescription } = getPageSeo('about');
---
<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalPath="/about.html"
  ogTitle={ogTitle}
  ogDescription={ogDescription}
  activeNav={"about"}
  navVariant={"marketing"}
  footerVariant={"full"}
  bodyClass={"light-theme"}
  showCta={true}
  includeMainJs={false}
  extraModuleScripts={[]}
  hideUntilLoad={true}
>
  <main>
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="container about-hero-inner">
        <div class="about-kicker">Our Story</div>
        <h1>Designed with lived experience, built for counselors</h1>
        <p>
          This didn't start in a boardroom. It started in an outpatient friend group that couldn't find their footing
          and a realisation that getting an overview was what finally made it possible to get control.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-story-card glass fade-in-up">
          <h2 data-i18n="about.storyTitle">How it started</h2>
          <p data-i18n="about.storyText">
            I smoked myself, and was part of an outpatient friend group. We were good at a lot of things, but having
            an overview of our own habits wasn't one of them. No structure. No patterns. Nothing to hold on to. So I
            started coding, not for a startup, not for a pitch deck, but for myself. Something to track. Somewhere to
            see what was actually happening. And slowly, it worked.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-two-col">
          <div class="about-card glass hover-lift fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
            <h2 data-i18n="about.whyTitle">Why treatment centers</h2>
            <p data-i18n="about.whyText">
              I know what it feels like from the citizen's side. I know what it means to show up to a session with
              nothing to offer and I know what happens when you finally start to see your own patterns. That's why I
              want to reach people right where they are: at treatment centers, through the people who work with them
              every day.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card glass hover-lift fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.15s">
            <h2 data-i18n="about.practitionerTitle">Practitioners deserve just as good an experience</h2>
            <p data-i18n="about.practitionerText">
              The citizens are the reason this exists, but the practitioners are the ones who make it work. I'll do my
              best to make sure your experience is just as good as theirs. If something's missing or could be better,
              say so. It's taken seriously.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-story-card glass fade-in-up">
          <h2 data-i18n="about.designTitle">Built with real users</h2>
          <p data-i18n="about.designText">
            SmokingTracker was developed with three cannabis users from the outset: one who just wanted to understand
            their consumption, one who wanted to reduce, and one who wanted to quit. That set three requirements:
            logging a session had to take three clicks, there could be no performance pressure, and the citizen had to
            define their own goal. The three treatment modes, Awareness, Reduce, and Quit, map directly to those three
            real people.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-creator-card glass fade-in-up">
          <div class="about-creator-text">
            <h2 data-i18n="about.creatorTitle">Who built this?</h2>
            <p data-i18n="about.creatorText">
              I'm not a company with a team of developers. I'm one person who coded their way out of a habit and wants
              to help others do the same. If you want to know more about me:
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.azlo.pro/da/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary" data-i18n="about.creatorLink">
            Visit azlo.pro
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .about-hero {
    background: var(--green-pale);
    padding: 4rem 2.5rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-hero-inner {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-kicker {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-hero p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-story-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .about-story-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-card {
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-primary, #4ade80);
  }

  .about-creator-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about-creator-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-creator-text p {
    opacity: 0.75;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-section {
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .about-section + .about-section {
    padding-top: 0;
  }
</style>
